# Service Structure Standards
RULE: engine/adapters/cli structure. engine/ has ZERO imports from adapters/. Adapters <100 lines, delegate to UCS/UMI/UCI/UEI.
WHY: Batch-live symmetry; dependencies point inward; thin adapters.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/service-structure-standards.md, 04-architecture/batch-live-symmetry.md
DO: engine/operations/, engine/processors/, engine/validation/, adapters/; config.py with ConfigStore
NEVER: app/core/ (use engine/); adapters importing engine; business logic in adapters
